      ],
      "deduplication": "文化遗产档案专门标注东门左右侧和正面，另有独立石铭与2019东瓮城工项。三角度只计同一东侧门组。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "east-left.jpg",
          "source": "https://digital.khs.go.kr/record/imageViewObjectStorageFile.do?ichDataUid=13997667350774322678&type=T",
