          "observation": "国家遗产外侧左视可见草坡踏石、上下错位的石墙端与狭窄侧入口。"
        },
        {
          "file": "east-right.jpg",
          "source": "https://digital.khs.go.kr/record/imageViewObjectStorageFile.do?ichDataUid=13997667352837323200&type=T",
          "sha256": "1d278752f92c6769edfab0e0e5b4af52db12af9a611b3ba2b2be39e7f56837cf",
          "observation": "右视见长城墙抵瓮墙，封口侧的曲面延至后方。"
        },
        {
          "file": "east-overview.jpg",
          "source": "https://digital.khs.go.kr/record/imageViewObjectStorageFile.do?ichDataUid=13997667354723323889&type=T",
          "sha256": "ffa3fa83db2036ec1e570585ceb575f3119b49700d9e28c97a70fec2d65ef8f3",
